# apps/agent

- Solution: `Warden.sln`. Primary UX: `Warden.Tray`.
- `Warden.Core` is a leaf library; LockUI/Tray/Agent reference it via sibling paths.
- Do not move Core/LockUI to `packages/` (ADR-0002).
- Bootstrap via `warden.json` or `WARDEN_API_BASE_URL`.
- Validate with `dotnet build apps/agent/Warden.sln`. No .NET test projects yet.
- Version: bump only `Directory.Build.props` on agent releases (ADR-0004). Base-10 carry — after `X.Y.9` next is `X.(Y+1).0`, never `X.Y.10`.
